WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.708
Step 1: Open Rostering → Timesheets and choose the location and week. Review individual staff cards in the grid; phones show one card per row.

2
00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:23.333
Step 2: Each staff card shows actual clock-in/out, paid hours, unpaid breaks and its matched published roster. Wage cost appears only with the existing wage permissions. Expand checks to review missing times, pay warnings or a variance; unknown and ambiguous roster matches stay unavailable.

3
00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:40.167
Step 3: Use Correct or a clock-time button to review a correction, including unpaid break minutes. A reason and explicit Save correction are required; this returns the record to pending. Break details shows recorded events. Approve, Reject, Reopen and History stay on the card; blocking checks must be resolved before approval.

4
00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:56.375
Step 4: Check rates and award warnings before approval. Pay details shows breaks first; expand Actual allowance details and reimbursements for worked kilometres, cold-work minutes, overtime meals or expenses, and enter only what actually applied. Approving eligible ordinary hours updates tracked annual-leave accrual. Use Export CSV for permitted entries.
